431,Suspends a player's access to the game for a period of time during which time they cannot pass the Persona Selection screen. <period> is in days by default, but can be specified as, e.g. "1d" or "2h" or "15m". **NOTE** Does not eject the player from the server -- see /kickban.
432,/bump [-up | -down] <player> <reason>
433,Displaces a player from their current position by a few meters /towards you/ e.g. to displace a clipper. Players cannot be bumped more than +/-4m horizontally or +/-6m vertically. Be careful not to pull players under the world. Specifying "-up" displays players 5m straight up regardless of your relative position. "-down" allows players to be pulled downward if you are below them.
