554,/spam  or  /spam +<message>  or /spam start <repetitions> <interval>  or  /spam stop
555,Manage/view/run the "spam can". The spam can is a list of text messages to be periodically broadcast to the playerbase as SYSTEM messages. Use "/spam" on its own to view the current spam can and settings; use "/spam +my message" to add "my message" to the end of the can; use "/spam start 5 3m" to repeat the spam can 5 times with 3 minutes between each repeat"; use "/spam stop" to stop (and clear) the current can.
556,Clearing the spam can.
557,/spam start <number of repetitions> <interval between repetitions>
558,Number of loops is how many times to repeat the entire can; interval between repetitions is a time interval (e.g. 30s, 5m, 2h or 1d) to pause between each repetition. The time between each line of the can is calculated based on the number of characters in the message.
559,Interval must be at least 30 seconds.
